WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,720
Did I come by chance and you followed us?

2
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:06,080
I’m following Su Ce

3
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:08,040
Are you here to collect loose paper today?

4
00:00:08,360 --> 00:00:10,700
Or come back to sting each other?

5
00:00:10,860 --> 00:00:15,680
Make up for the job you are missing and save others

6
00:00:15,960 --> 00:00:17,760
I don’t care if you are the same after I take it away

7
00:00:17,960 --> 00:00:19,560
If you are in school, you will be charged half a box more.

8
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:24,100
Didn't you go to the toilet?

9
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:26,020
Why did it feel like I fell after running for ten kilometers?

10
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:35,100
Why are you doing your job more weirdly than the other today? An aid price is two boxes for a rabbit.

11
00:00:35,180 --> 00:00:37,420
You actually made an extra frame and a half, so how do you calculate it?

12
00:00:37,620 --> 00:00:40,180
You can't cut it into quarters and only three.

13
00:00:40,380 --> 00:00:41,620
Extra acid efficiency bonus

14
00:00:42,910 --> 00:00:45,350
Aren't you afraid that we will deliberately do more in the future to force you to increase the price?

15
00:00:45,430 --> 00:00:47,470
The reward is given by me on my own initiative and is not a fixed contract.

16
00:00:47,710 --> 00:00:49,590
Next time the price will be as reasonable as discussed next time

17
00:00:49,710 --> 00:00:51,670
Temporary rewards cannot automatically become permanent standards

18
00:00:51,870 --> 00:00:53,190
Today's work was not in vain
